sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant Stack as Owned launcher
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Model
    participant Supabase
    Operator->>Stack: status_all + health
    Stack->>Frontend: loopback readiness
    Stack->>Backend: GET /health and /ready
    Backend->>Model: local /models probe
    Stack->>Supabase: configured health only
    alt one owned layer failed
        Stack-->>Operator: typed cause + owned log/PID
        Operator->>Stack: stop failed owned layer
        Operator->>Stack: restart smallest dependency chain
        Stack-->>Operator: loopback URLs and verified readiness
    else hosted/external dependency failed
        Stack-->>Operator: explicit unavailable/partial state
        Note over Stack,Supabase: Never stop or mutate hosted Supabase
    end
    Operator->>Frontend: retry exact operation idempotently
